(7473467, 1187248, 101668, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous</td>', 'Gorgeous', '2016-09-09 13:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473486, 1187212, 12611, '<td valign="top">I thought there was going to be a motherhood/womb/fetal reference- notwithstanding, an interesting set-up.</td>', 'I thought there was going to be a motherhood/womb/fetal reference- notwithstanding, an interesting set-up.', '2016-09-09 14:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473487, 1187247, 12611, '<td valign="top">such great joy. well played.</td>', 'such great joy. well played.', '2016-09-09 14:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473488, 1186941, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the story here, and so much can be said by feet legs and shoes.</td>', 'I love the story here, and so much can be said by feet legs and shoes.', '2016-09-09 14:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473489, 1187259, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent sentiment and capture.</td>', 'Excellent sentiment and capture.', '2016-09-09 14:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473491, 1187141, 12611, '<td valign="top">great light and depth, particularly emotional for such an immediately indiscernible shot.</td>', 'great light and depth, particularly emotional for such an immediately indiscernible shot.', '2016-09-09 14:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473492, 1187264, 12611, '<td valign="top">great capture.</td>', 'great capture.', '2016-09-09 14:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473493, 1187024, 12611, '<td valign="top">The scratchy overlay works particularly well.</td>', 'The scratchy overlay works particularly well.', '2016-09-09 14:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473494, 1187238, 12611, '<td valign="top">love it- the lack of title, the bathroom, the statue, and the empty chair(s).</td>', 'love it- the lack of title, the bathroom, the statue, and the empty chair(s).', '2016-09-09 14:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473495, 1187252, 12611, '<td valign="top">great clarity, well done.</td>', 'great clarity, well done.', '2016-09-09 14:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473496, 1187211, 12611, '<td valign="top">The resemblance is unmistakable, now lets get a weissbier!</td>', 'The resemblance is unmistakable, now lets get a weissbier!', '2016-09-09 14:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473497, 1187217, 12611, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrayal. Amazing what can be displayed, the depth and feeling of emotion and abstract concepts, within the bounds of a split second photograph.</td>', 'Very nice portrayal. Amazing what can be displayed, the depth and feeling of emotion and abstract concepts, within the bounds of a split second photograph.', '2016-09-09 14:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473498, 1186956, 12611, '<td valign="top">great picture, and such a great example of a paradigm concept of commitment.</td>', 'great picture, and such a great example of a paradigm concept of commitment.', '2016-09-09 14:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473523, 1187258, 12611, '<td valign="top">Super. Such a feel to it.</td>', 'Super. Such a feel to it.', '2016-09-09 22:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473524, 1187031, 12611, '<td valign="top">Jackson Pollock''s tree trunk. I have this lichen style stuff all over my detached garage roof.</td>', 'Jackson Pollock''s tree trunk. I have this lichen style stuff all over my detached garage roof.', '2016-09-09 22:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473525, 1187230, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2016-09-09 22:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473526, 1187237, 12611, '<td valign="top">Thats a young one. Quite touching.</td>', 'Thats a young one. Quite touching.', '2016-09-09 22:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473577, 1187247, 114285, '<td valign="top">Not only perfect for the challenge  (something I actually wanted to do but I didn''t have a wedding booking these past two weekend''s) it''s also a very beautiful photo.  I love the joyful look on their faces and all the  confetti, obviously this is the winner by a mile!<br/> <br/> I''m guessing this is Alex, they look Italian.<br/> <br/>Ps editing is superb too!<br/> <br/>PPS   I hope they do last,  also something very rare these days :-)</td>', 'Not only perfect for the challenge  (something I actually wanted to do but I didn''t have a wedding booking these past two weekend''s) it''s also a very beautiful photo.  I love the joyful look on their faces and all the  confetti, obviously this is the winner by a mile!  I''m guessing this is Alex, they look Italian. Ps editing is superb too! PPS   I hope they do last,  also something very rare these days :-)', '2016-09-10 22:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473620, 1187217, 101256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and enchanting.</td>', 'Beautiful and enchanting.', '2016-09-11 16:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473621, 1187206, 101256, '<td valign="top">Examines commitment roles from an entirely different perspective - excellent.</td>', 'Examines commitment roles from an entirely different perspective - excellent.', '2016-09-11 16:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473622, 1187007, 101256, '<td valign="top">A worthy effort</td>', 'A worthy effort', '2016-09-11 16:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473623, 1187248, 101256, '<td valign="top">A tad over done, but meaningful - interesting composition</td>', 'A tad over done, but meaningful - interesting composition', '2016-09-11 16:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473625, 1187148, 101256, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy outside-the-box composition - interesting effects - very cool concept.  I like it.  Worth a 10 to me.</td>', 'I really enjoy outside-the-box composition - interesting effects - very cool concept.  I like it.  Worth a 10 to me.', '2016-09-11 16:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473627, 1187264, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great idea and a difficult capture. Just shy of being a terrific image.</td>', 'A great idea and a difficult capture. Just shy of being a terrific image.', '2016-09-11 16:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473628, 1187230, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not at all unappealing, but rather pedestrian in execution.</td>', 'Not at all unappealing, but rather pedestrian in execution.', '2016-09-11 16:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473629, 1187263, 101256, '<td valign="top">Detail is incredible and the obvious trust between dog and human is very evident.  Then again, I''m biased as a dog owner. Nicely done.</td>', 'Detail is incredible and the obvious trust between dog and human is very evident.  Then again, I''m biased as a dog owner. Nicely done.', '2016-09-11 16:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473630, 1186993, 101256, '<td valign="top">Earns a 10 because nothing says commitment than offering being in the armed service of your country.</td>', 'Earns a 10 because nothing says commitment than offering being in the armed service of your country.', '2016-09-11 16:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473631, 1187261, 101256, '<td valign="top">I had to return to this -I wasn''t sure if I wanted to comment or not. I''ll just say it is a very "busy" image although it does convey the meaning of commitment even to an inanimate object.</td>', 'I had to return to this -I wasn''t sure if I wanted to comment or not. I''ll just say it is a very "busy" image although it does convey the meaning of commitment even to an inanimate object.', '2016-09-11 16:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473632, 1187252, 101256, '<td valign="top">I am offering a 6 even though it is similar to others in concept and execution.</td>', 'I am offering a 6 even though it is similar to others in concept and execution.', '2016-09-11 16:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473633, 1187238, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not at all sure what this is meant to convey. Its also overly dark - which may or may not be intended, but the image is so ambiguous that it is hard to rate. Fifty fifty I guess.</td>', 'I''m not at all sure what this is meant to convey. Its also overly dark - which may or may not be intended, but the image is so ambiguous that it is hard to rate. Fifty fifty I guess.', '2016-09-11 16:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473634, 1187237, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture - Mon and colt - like the overall earth tone feel to the image - conceptually it fits the category perfectly. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice capture - Mon and colt - like the overall earth tone feel to the image - conceptually it fits the category perfectly. Well done.', '2016-09-11 16:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473635, 1187211, 101256, '<td valign="top">I love it - not sure if the person in the wheel chair is hanging on for dear life or not, but its a really fun look. And having spent a month in a wheel chair a few months back, I can fully appreciate being pushed around. I like it. Nice tones, very smooth effect, excellent sharpness - very well done</td>', 'I love it - not sure if the person in the wheel chair is hanging on for dear life or not, but its a really fun look. And having spent a month in a wheel chair a few months back, I can fully appreciate being pushed around. I like it. Nice tones, very smooth effect, excellent sharpness - very well done', '2016-09-11 16:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473636, 1187234, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another wonderful "outside-the-box" concept with excellent execution. Can''t say enough about this one - it should place very high in the competition.</td>', 'Another wonderful "outside-the-box" concept with excellent execution. Can''t say enough about this one - it should place very high in the competition.', '2016-09-11 16:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473637, 1187102, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - a little more thought into title would have been of significant benefit. I like the sweep from left to right which gives you time to come to a conclusion as to what it conveys.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like this a lot - a little more thought into title would have been of significant benefit. I like the sweep from left to right which gives you time to come to a conclusion as to what it conveys.  Nicely done.', '2016-09-11 16:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473639, 1187159, 101256, '<td valign="top">A 9 just because I like the sense of humor and whimsy. Not often you get humor expressed quite this way.  I really like it. Nice composition evenly balanced with very good conceptual execution. Well done.</td>', 'A 9 just because I like the sense of humor and whimsy. Not often you get humor expressed quite this way.  I really like it. Nice composition evenly balanced with very good conceptual execution. Well done.', '2016-09-11 16:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473640, 1187024, 101256, '<td valign="top">I hate to get too picky, but there appears to be some straight line artifact on the right lower which sort of distracts from the overall idea. Some more thought might have helped this, but then again, the photographer might not have had the time.  A worthy effort as the concept is very good.</td>', 'I hate to get too picky, but there appears to be some straight line artifact on the right lower which sort of distracts from the overall idea. Some more thought might have helped this, but then again, the photographer might not have had the time.  A worthy effort as the concept is very good.', '2016-09-11 16:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473641, 1187186, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like HDR images (or near HDR), but sometimes they can be overdone. This, however is not overdone at all. The image does require some extended time to properly evaluate however. Very good execution (no pun intended) - conveys all sorts of ideas about commitment from the thrower to the throwee.</td>', 'I like HDR images (or near HDR), but sometimes they can be overdone. This, however is not overdone at all. The image does require some extended time to properly evaluate however. Very good execution (no pun intended) - conveys all sorts of ideas about commitment from the thrower to the throwee.', '2016-09-11 16:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473642, 1187244, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little uneven exposure which may have been intentional. A worthy effort, but not to my taste.</td>', 'A little uneven exposure which may have been intentional. A worthy effort, but not to my taste.', '2016-09-11 16:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473643, 1187218, 101256, '<td valign="top">Excellent title, excellent concept, love the grain effect - a top ten image for sure. Well done.</td>', 'Excellent title, excellent concept, love the grain effect - a top ten image for sure. Well done.', '2016-09-11 16:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473644, 1186962, 101256, '<td valign="top">I would have titled this "not today buddy" or "I have a headache"...very nice image, excellent detail - wonderful color. Should be a top ten image at the very least if not top five. Well done.</td>', 'I would have titled this "not today buddy" or "I have a headache"...very nice image, excellent detail - wonderful color. Should be a top ten image at the very least if not top five. Well done.', '2016-09-11 16:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473645, 1187258, 101256, '<td valign="top">I must admit, I don''t get this one at all.  But, I like the capture and processing - very intriguing.</td>', 'I must admit, I don''t get this one at all.  But, I like the capture and processing - very intriguing.', '2016-09-11 17:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473646, 1186956, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wow - just plain old wow. Great capture.</td>', 'Wow - just plain old wow. Great capture.', '2016-09-11 17:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473647, 1187136, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another one that is far "outside the box" and I like it if only because it looks like a water color painting. I understand the title, but I''m not sure if others get it. Artemis is a greek god of nature (or environment).  A title should convey the meaning immediately.  However, the image is wonderful despite the title and it is well worth a top ten finish.</td>', 'Another one that is far "outside the box" and I like it if only because it looks like a water color painting. I understand the title, but I''m not sure if others get it. Artemis is a greek god of nature (or environment).  A title should convey the meaning immediately.  However, the image is wonderful despite the title and it is well worth a top ten finish.', '2016-09-11 17:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473648, 1186492, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good action capture which is certainly well within the idea of Commitment. However, I feel a little lighter exposure or maybe some post processing massaging would have help this a lot.  Still a worthy entry given the nature of the title.</td>', 'A good action capture which is certainly well within the idea of Commitment. However, I feel a little lighter exposure or maybe some post processing massaging would have help this a lot.  Still a worthy entry given the nature of the title.', '2016-09-11 17:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473649, 1187246, 101256, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and the whole idea. Nicely executed - a worthy effort.</td>', 'Like the composition and the whole idea. Nicely executed - a worthy effort.', '2016-09-11 17:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473650, 1187031, 101256, '<td valign="top">Had to think about this one for a minute.  I like it, but I''m not sure if the idea is that the fungi is committed to the tree or vice versa. The image is richly detailed which is nothing shorty of spectacular. I have to give it a ten from an execution standpoint - well done.</td>', 'Had to think about this one for a minute.  I like it, but I''m not sure if the idea is that the fungi is committed to the tree or vice versa. The image is richly detailed which is nothing shorty of spectacular. I have to give it a ten from an execution standpoint - well done.', '2016-09-11 17:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473651, 1187254, 101256, '<td valign="top">There are other images in this challenge similar, but this has a certain charm that cannot be denied. Good color and detail - a worth challenge image.</td>', 'There are other images in this challenge similar, but this has a certain charm that cannot be denied. Good color and detail - a worth challenge image.', '2016-09-11 17:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473652, 1186988, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little over done - could have used a little more brightening or more contrast. Good idea though - just shy of being a stellar image.</td>', 'A little over done - could have used a little more brightening or more contrast. Good idea though - just shy of being a stellar image.', '2016-09-11 17:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473653, 1187001, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what this has to do with commitment but I''ll allow for benefit of doubt. Nicely detailed, composition is.....interesting to say the least.</td>', 'Not quite sure what this has to do with commitment but I''ll allow for benefit of doubt. Nicely detailed, composition is.....interesting to say the least.', '2016-09-11 17:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473654, 1187146, 101256, '<td valign="top">Congratulations to the couple for their years of commitment. Good idea, hands show a lot of character and life experience, nicely detailed, but similar to other imagery in this challenge. Still, a worthy submission.</td>', 'Congratulations to the couple for their years of commitment. Good idea, hands show a lot of character and life experience, nicely detailed, but similar to other imagery in this challenge. Still, a worthy submission.', '2016-09-11 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473656, 1186917, 101256, '<td valign="top">This might have worked better in color rather than the tint. Like the concept and the idea of a stroll down a beach. Nice image, peaceful and serene. Well done.</td>', 'This might have worked better in color rather than the tint. Like the concept and the idea of a stroll down a beach. Nice image, peaceful and serene. Well done.', '2016-09-11 17:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473657, 1187247, 101256, '<td valign="top">Like the B&amp;W as a whole, but I just can''t bring myself to say I like the specifics. It just looks much to busy, although the joy of the event is very evident. Whatever has been thrown, bird seed I assume, distracts from the idea of commitment.</td>', 'Like the B&W as a whole, but I just can''t bring myself to say I like the specifics. It just looks much to busy, although the joy of the event is very evident. Whatever has been thrown, bird seed I assume, distracts from the idea of commitment.', '2016-09-11 17:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473658, 1186941, 101256, '<td valign="top">I really don''t know what to say about this one - I''m obviously missing the point.</td>', 'I really don''t know what to say about this one - I''m obviously missing the point.', '2016-09-11 17:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473659, 1186936, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another image that I don''t understand in terms of the challenge. Still, it is an entry so its worth something - it''s always worth something.</td>', 'Another image that I don''t understand in terms of the challenge. Still, it is an entry so its worth something - it''s always worth something.', '2016-09-11 17:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473660, 1187141, 101256, '<td valign="top">As opposed to them? Those? I don''t get it. Sorry.</td>', 'As opposed to them? Those? I don''t get it. Sorry.', '2016-09-11 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473661, 1187257, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sadly,this could have been a winner - unfortunately the white blooms distract from the rest of the image which is brilliant.  Perhaps a little less post processing was in order.</td>', 'Sadly,this could have been a winner - unfortunately the white blooms distract from the rest of the image which is brilliant.  Perhaps a little less post processing was in order.', '2016-09-11 17:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473662, 1187212, 101256, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this twice. The first time I thought it was a wall hanging, then I realized it was taken from above - which means that it has some significance in terms of visual appeal. I like the even tones, the whole concept and execution in taking the image. This should be a top five image.</td>', 'I had to look at this twice. The first time I thought it was a wall hanging, then I realized it was taken from above - which means that it has some significance in terms of visual appeal. I like the even tones, the whole concept and execution in taking the image. This should be a top five image.', '2016-09-11 17:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473664, 1187259, 101256, '<td valign="top">Indeed it did and congratulations to the happy couple. Nice standard wedding image matching the concepts expressed by the challenge.</td>', 'Indeed it did and congratulations to the happy couple. Nice standard wedding image matching the concepts expressed by the challenge.', '2016-09-11 17:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
