(7474858, 1187186, 150277, '<td valign="top">I struggle with lots of things, but choosing that ideal composition is one of them.  I had cropped the image some, but I wonder if cropping even more to emphasize my subject might have been stronger?  <br/> <br/>But for me to have had success with the timing was a win in itself.  I mean come on, that flying cucumber moved fast.  <br/> <br/>And to commit enough to a job to let someone throw knives at you...</td>', 'I struggle with lots of things, but choosing that ideal composition is one of them.  I had cropped the image some, but I wonder if cropping even more to emphasize my subject might have been stronger?   But for me to have had success with the timing was a win in itself.  I mean come on, that flying cucumber moved fast.   And to commit enough to a job to let someone throw knives at you...', '2016-09-21 00:10:38.000000', NULL, 0),
